module examples.err_layout_overlap

# plans/M7.md item B, 03-hardware.md §2: the compiler checks "non-overlap"
# — "two live layouts can never alias a register", and neither can two
# fields of one layout. `interrupt_ack`'s explicit offset lands inside the
# four bytes `interrupt_status` already covers.

@layout(mmio, endian=little)
struct VirtioIrqMmio:
    @offset(0x060) interrupt_status: ReadOnly[u32]
    @offset(0x060) interrupt_ack: WriteOnly[u32]
